 *   2024-03-05T14:30:15             local time
 *   2024-03-05T14:30:15.123         local time with fractional seconds
 *   2024-03-05T14:30:15Z            UTC
 *   2024-03-05T14:30:15+02:00       explicit offset (also +0200 or +02)
 *
