 *   - Full timestamp:   "2024-01-15T13:45:30Z"
 *   - With millis:      "2024-01-15T13:45:30.123Z"
 *   - With offset:      "2024-01-15T13:45:30+02:00"
 *   - Week / ordinal:   "2024-W03-1", "2024-015"
 *
 * Date-only strings are interpreted as UTC midnight (unlike `new Date("2024-01-15")`
 * in some engines, which is also UTC — but we make it explicit and consistent).
 *
